WEBVTT

00:09:48.534 --> 00:10:24.197
★Tom grew up in a small village, but when he finished university, he moved to the city to work. A few years later, his parents called him and said they were having trouble with their farm. Tom went back to the village to help them. He decided to stay and help his parents. Now, he enjoys teaching people from the city about farming.
☆☆Question: What does Tom do now?
